# Walkthrough - AI Client Timeout Fix

## Changes Overview
Resolved issues where AI requests (Recipe suggestions, Cooking instructions) would timeout after 10s by switching to specific `aiApiClient` (60s timeout).

### Files Modified
- **[OnboardingScreen.tsx](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/app/screens/auth/OnboardingScreen.tsx)**: Updated [calculateNutrition](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/app/screens/auth/OnboardingScreen.tsx#202-235) to extract nutrition targets using the 60s timeout client.
- **[nutrition.ts](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/services/nutrition.ts)**: Switched [suggestNutrition](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/services/nutrition.ts#20-27) and [applyNutrition](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/services/nutrition.ts#28-40) to use `aiApiClient`.
- **[aiService.ts](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/services/aiService.ts)**: 
  - Updated [suggestRecipes](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/services/aiService.ts#110-139) and [suggestRecipesEnhanced](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/services/aiService.ts#263-270) to use `aiApiClient`.
  - Refactored [getCookingInstructions](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/services/aiService.ts#340-362) to use `aiApiClient` instead of `fetch`, enabling automatic token injection and extending timeout to 60s.

## Verification
- **Lint Check**: Passed (`npm run lint` with strict typescript checking).
- **Manual Check Required**:
  1. Open app > "Thêm món ăn" > "AI Scan" > "Gợi ý món".
  2. Verify creating cooking instructions does not error out immediately.

## UI Animation Refinements
Adjusted spring physics to reduce "bounciness" and improve speed.

### Files Modified
- **[Modal.tsx](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/components/Modal.tsx)**: Increased damping (18 -> 30) and stiffness (400 -> 300) for a "tighter", less bouncy feel.
- **[FAB.tsx](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/components/FAB.tsx)**: Applied same spring config as Modal for consistency.
- **[SmartAddSheet.tsx](file:///d:/Project/PTUD%20eatfitAL/coding/EatFitAI_v1/eatfitai-mobile/src/components/ui/SmartAddSheet.tsx)**: Changed entrance to `springify` for smoother slide-up animation.

### Verification
- **Manual Check**:
  - Open any Modal: Should feel stable and responsive.
  - Press FAB: Should have subtle press effect without oscillating.
  - Open SmartAdd (+) menu: Should slide up naturally.
